1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,475
This is ParkinSense P K:

2
00:00:02,475 --> 00:00:03,575
a research prototype

3
00:00:03,575 --> 00:00:08,000
for reviewing everyday movement and
speech.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,012
Six sections bring together

5
00:00:10,012 --> 00:00:12,188
walking, hands, sit-to-stand,

6
00:00:12,188 --> 00:00:13,200
reach and grasp,

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:18,000
voice, and daily activities.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,100
This walking replay comes from

9
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,613
a published clinical recording.

10
00:00:22,613 --> 00:00:24,400
The model tracks body landmarks

11
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,425
in three dimensions.

12
00:00:26,425 --> 00:00:32,000
These estimates are not calibrated clinical
measurements.

13
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,825
Here, a published finger-tapping recording

14
00:00:34,825 --> 00:00:36,850
becomes a three-dimensional hand replay

15
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:38,700
and movement curve.

16
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,300
The source does not specify

17
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,000
the participant’s diagnosis.

18
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,938
The voice module measures signal activity,

19
00:00:48,938 --> 00:00:50,888
pauses, and estimated pitch

20
00:00:50,888 --> 00:00:52,788
from real audio.

21
00:00:52,788 --> 00:00:54,600
These are acoustic measurements,

22
00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:58,000
not a Parkinson’s diagnosis.

23
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,575
The report brings recording quality,

24
00:01:00,575 --> 00:01:04,037
measurements, and limitations into one
view.

25
00:01:04,037 --> 00:01:05,338
A clinician still needs

26
00:01:05,338 --> 00:01:08,000
to review the findings.

27
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,787
The archived suite passed

28
00:01:09,787 --> 00:01:12,209
four hundred and sixty-three tests.

29
00:01:12,209 --> 00:01:14,747
Wrong-task checks exposed a limitation:

30
00:01:14,747 --> 00:01:18,000
human task confirmation is still needed.

31
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,104
Next come independent measurement
validation,

32
00:01:21,104 --> 00:01:22,811
patient usability testing,

33
00:01:22,811 --> 00:01:26,000
and supervised clinic evaluation.

34
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,895
Built from research recordings.

35
00:01:28,895 --> 00:01:32,000
Clinical validation is still ahead.
